<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugo bank to approve credits for wheat stocking.</title>
<headline>Yugo bank to approve credits for wheat stocking.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vojvodjanska banka of Novi Sad will approve credits to wheat milling and seed wheat processing firms for financing stocks of wheat from the 1997 crop, Belgrade daily Politika reported on Friday.</p>
<p>The total amount of credits to be granted is 124 million dinars at 1.7 percent monthly interest with repayment terms from September to October this year, the report said.</p>
<p>-- Amra Kevic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 311 4305</p>
</text>
